  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) that is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if <b>uuid</b> and the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Prim" target="_blank">prim</a> the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Script" target="_blank">script</a> is in are of the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Group" target="_blank">group</a>, otherwise <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>ID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/uuid" target="_blank">uuid</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Group" target="_blank">group</a>,&amp;#32;<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Avatar" target="_blank">avatar</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Prim" target="_blank">prim</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> that is in the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a></td>
